OL,3,GNEWSA'Frustration' as #5m market
OL,4,Aremains shuttered
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe long-awaited opening of Newton
OL,7,FAbbot's new Market Hall remains on hold
OL,8,Fwhile "due diligence" is carried out
OL,9,Fabout its future operations.
OL,11,FShoppers said they were frustrated the
OL,12,Fnew market building was sitting empty
OL,13,Fwith many airing frustration on social
OL,14,Fmedia and one saying: "At the moment
OL,15,Fit's another white elephant."
OL,17,FThe regeneration of the Market Hall was
OL,18,Ffunded by #5m from the government's
OL,19,FFuture High Streets Fund, and was
OL,20,Fcompleted in June.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
