OL,3,GNEWSA'Frustration' as #5m market
OL,4,Aremains shuttered
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was due to open in the autumn but
OL,7,FTeignbridge Council was still going
OL,8,Fthrough the formalities and David
OL,9,FPalethorpe, the councillor leading the
OL,10,Fproject, said: "We understand the
OL,11,Ffrustrations but we'd rather do this
OL,12,Fslowly and get it right."
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
